{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261026/photo/bkn-20261026094445416-1026_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261026160852\"/><p>銀線灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日(26日)宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘、石澳泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:25.480829+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:44:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:18.375140+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:16.919826+00:00","content_hash":"00ba7712963a51f0d140e65c09848c6d285044a4b352e7d72fd24b3a3aa8ef84","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}